          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n10 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 26 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (plus, on a critical failure, slowed 1 as long as it's sickened). While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            },
